cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and keep the data attributions in NOTICE.md."
title: "BibleSkill: an AI workflow for translating the Hebrew Bible and Greek New Testament into Chinese"
abstract: >-
  Agent skills and a Model Context Protocol (MCP) server for translating the
  biblical source texts into Chinese with large language models: clause
  analysis, clause-by-clause translation at five literalness levels,
  glossary consistency, review, and flagging of textual variants and
  interpretive disputes. Built only from openly licensed data (STEPBible,
  Macula, UBS Chinese dictionaries).
type: software
authors:
  - alias: lodebar2026
repository-code: "https://github.com/lodebar2026/BibleSkill"
url: "https://github.com/lodebar2026/BibleSkill"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Bible translation
  - Chinese Bible
  - Biblical Hebrew
  - Koine Greek
  - Greek New Testament
  - Hebrew Bible
  - clause analysis
  - Model Context Protocol
  - large language models
  - STEPBible
  - Macula
